{
  "$note": [
    "Corpus for the tier-1 avatar cache key differential (P4.D184, v4 7fbf8a55b).",
    "Read by BOTH sides: harness/oracle/cases/avatar-cache-key.ts drives v4's real",
    "deriveAvatarCacheKey / deriveLegacyAvatarCacheKey / deriveAvatarCacheKeys, and",
    "crates/quilltap-harness/tests/avatar_cache_key_equivalence.rs drives v5's.",
    "",
    "Two sentinels express what JSON cannot say:",
    "  \"__UNDEFINED__\"  a key present with the value `undefined`. The v4 runner",
    "                    substitutes a real `undefined`; v5 REMOVES the key, because",
    "                    a serde_json::Value has no undefined and to_key_value omits",
    "                    every None. The <...>-absent sibling of each such case must",
    "                    hash IDENTICALLY — that identity is the whole point.",
    "  \"__ABSENT__\"     (v0 modelName only) the key is not present at all, as",
    "                    against an explicit null. v4's `?? null` makes them one key.",
    "",
    "kind: v1  -> deriveAvatarCacheKey({provider, imageProfileId, params})",
    "kind: v0  -> deriveLegacyAvatarCacheKey({modelName, prompt})",
    "kind: pair-> deriveAvatarCacheKeys({provider, imageProfileId, params}) (both)"
  ],
